@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# VCM screening hooks (branch `vcm-hooks`, based on tag VTM-24.0)
+
+Encoder-side instrumentation for the screening experiments in
+[Minh10/vcm-vvc-screening](https://github.com/Minh10/vcm-vvc-screening). The decoder, the syntax and every normative
+process are untouched. All options are empty by default; with every option empty the encoder output is
+byte-identical to VTM-24.0 (checked on AI and LDP, see `docs/ALF_CODEC_AUDIT.md` in the screening repo).
+
+| Option | Branch | Effect |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `--VCMQpOffsetFile=<csv>` | A (RAMU-Lite) | CSV `poc,ctu_addr,delta_qp`. Turns on DQP signalling and sets the QP of every quantization group of the listed CTUs to base QP + delta (lambda follows via `EncCu::updateLambda`). An empty file (header only) gives the DQP-enabled anchor. A delta only takes effect where the CU codes a residual (`cu_qp_delta` is not sent otherwise). |
+| `--VCMTraceFile=<csv>` | A | Output only. One row per final luma CU: `poc,coding_order,temporal_id,x,y,w,h,qp,mode,ref_poc0,mv0x,mv0y,ref_poc1,mv1x,mv1y,resid_energy,flags,mv_spread,ref_mixed`. `qp` is the CU's final QP as the decoder derives it; MVs (luma samples) are read from the stored motion field at the CU centre; `flags` = `affine4/affine6/geo/ciip/mmvd/ibc/plt` joined by `|`; `mv_spread` = max L-inf distance (luma samples) of the CU's 4x4 motion-field MVs from the centre MV; `ref_mixed` = number of 4x4 units whose list usage or reference differs from the centre (GEO). |
+| `--VCMAlfWeightDir=<dir>` | B (O1-B) | Reads `w_<poc>.f32` (float32, luma width x height) and uses it as the per-sample weight of the luma ALF statistics (replacing the HDR luma-level WSSD weight). Unit weights reproduce the default bitstream exactly. A missing map is an error. |
+| `--VCMAlfExternalFile=<txt>` | B (O1-A') | `vcm-alf-luma-txt-v1` file: per listed POC, 25 classes x (12 coefficients, 12 clipping indices). The picture gets a new APS with exactly these luma filters (25 filters, no merging) used in every CTB; luma ALF cannot be switched off for it. Unlisted pictures keep the VTM decisions and may reuse an earlier external APS. |
+| `--VCMAlfDumpDir=<dir>` | B | Writes `pre_/post_/org_<poc>.y16` (luma before/after ALF and original, int16, internal bit depth), `ctb_<poc>.txt` (AlfMode and the 25 x (12 coeff, 12 clip values) used per CTB) and `meta.txt`. |
+
+Files changed: `EncAppCfg.{h,cpp}`, `EncApp.cpp`, `EncCfg.h`, `EncLib.cpp` (DQP on), `EncModeCtrl.cpp` (QP),
+`EncCu.cpp` (lambda update condition), `EncSlice.{h,cpp}` (trace), `EncAdaptiveLoopFilter.{h,cpp}` (ALF hooks).
